    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about boundaries for them though. they do it because they feel like they have to. i see it in their eyes when they're helping me. it's like they're just constantly exhausted by me. it's not like i can just 'adapt' my way out of being a constant, draining obligation. i just feel like a mistake that everyone is too polite to point out.",
